# Home tile names that do not fit the tile (2026-11-02): a name is one line and never touches the icon. Too wide for
# the tile: a smaller font (down to about 80 % of the normal size), then an ellipsis. Short names ("Net Walk",
# "Calculator") keep the normal size. 480x800 is the PDA portrait (profile pda). Review only: no golden; look at the
# images (the long names must stay under their icons).
title home long names
review
sizes 480x320 640x480 480x800
@480x800 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
apps "Home Assistant"=fixture:2048_128.png "Markdown Notes"=fixture:2048_128.png "System Monitor"=fixture:2048_128.png "Klondike Solitaire"=fixture:2048_128.png "Serial Console"=fixture:2048_128.png "Net Toolbox"=fixture:2048_128.png "Net Walk"=fixture:2048_128.png Calculator "Packet Radar Extended Edition"=fixture:2048_128.png "Mine Field"=fixture:2048_128.png Settings CLI
home
shot home_long_names
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot home_long_names_selected
